Full Name: Border Collie
Description: The Border Collie is a British breed of herding dog of the collie type of medium size. It originates in the region of the Anglo-Scottish border, and descends from the traditional sheepdogs once found all over the British Isles. It is kept mostly as a working sheep-herding dog or as a companion animal.[1] It competes with success in sheepdog trials. It has been claimed that it is the most intelligent breed of dog.[2]